Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:04.07,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So, when are you guys going to have the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When I have enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:10.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why did you marry a poor guy like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Because I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:14.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be so frank about it; you'll make me depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be calling you "Father" from now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:20.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,No way! You'll creep me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But you are my father-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:25.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,right, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:30.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then I'll call you "Son" from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right, Son?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:35.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop that, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:35.77,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Son!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.19,0:00:36.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.73,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Son!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:37.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:41.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Father!
