Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.93,0:01:55.22,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.93,0:01:55.22,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.43,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.43,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.94,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
