Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:03.90,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:03.90,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
