Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\b1\c&HA7AC98&\fs108\pos(958.5,394.5)}Okazaki Tomoya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\b1\c&HA7AC98&\fs108\pos(1065,487.5)}Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:17.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:18.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:22.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to say at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Say what about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:29.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Today's the start of our new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Should I be saying, "Ready, set, go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:35.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That'd be strange, since there's no finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:38.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:44.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Since we're going to be living together by supporting each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,it's probably, "Please take good care of me."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to make an oath between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,An oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:59.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I, Okazaki Nagisa, will not cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:02.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No matter the hardship, I will overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:08.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I may cry in happy situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...but I hope you will take good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Same here. I hope you'll take good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:29.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 14
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:29.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}A New Family
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:39.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:40.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:45.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is it really all right for me to get in the bath first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:50.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I'll get in first tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:54.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I'll take a dip first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:07.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Calm down. I've heard the sound of Nagisa showering in that house many times. {ep13}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! {ep13}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:13.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Cold water came out... {ep13}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, it takes a while before hot water comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Start it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:28.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, I'll try to get out fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:31.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry; take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:37.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can't do that. You have work tomorrow, so you have to go to bed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:49.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll start looking for a job tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:50.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:57.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,A job. I can't be doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you serious about working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:17.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Of course, I won't neglect the household chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,After all, this is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:27.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll do chores around the house, too. But, is your body holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:35.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I am physically weak, but I don't want to be a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:41.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry; I'm being selfish again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:44.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've never wished for anything grand in your life, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:52.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm always asking a lot from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:59.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All you ever ask for are things like playing baseball with the old man and holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:25.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We're married, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:32.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet lots of things will happen to us from here on;\Namazing things and painful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:36.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I'll be able to face them as long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:41.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Same here. As long as you're with me,\NI think I can handle anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:45.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So make sure you always stay by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:48.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:53.40,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(0,500)\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\b1\fs108\pos(958.5,394.5)\c&H61605D&}Okazaki Tomoya
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:53.40,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(0,500)\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\b1\fs108\pos(1065,487.5)\c&H61605D&}Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:52.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:59.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is how Nagisa and my new life started. {ep13}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:03.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I needed to support the lives of two people starting that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:09.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But rather than a burden, to me, it was joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When I got off from work, I headed straight for home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To the home where Nagisa waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I called Nishina-san today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:50.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She gave me her phone number at the graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:52.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She wasn't admitted to a college, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.79,0:07:56.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. She's studying now to enter a music school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:08:02.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She said she's working since she didn't want to be a burden on her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:04.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wow, good for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:09.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I heard she's going to work at\Na family restaurant that opens next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:12.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She asked me if I would like to work with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:13.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:15.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. As a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:20.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm also looking for a job,\Nso I thought it would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:23.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's better than going to a place full of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:27.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But let the old man and Sanae-san know, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:28.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:39.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's on your mind, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:43.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What Miyazawa said some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:46.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There's a legend from the early days of this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:50.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When there are blessed people around, a light appears near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:57.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was thinking that a light could be around us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If we get a hold of a light,\Nwe can have a wish granted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What would you ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:10.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've got to have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Really, I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Actually, there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:20.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really? What is it? If you say it, I'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,A baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:26.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:38.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:40.73,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Welco- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:42.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I got out early, so I had some free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought I'd show my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Really? This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:57.46,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this opportunity the last couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:02.46,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We're going to go see Nagisa work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:07.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:12.85,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What kind of guy goes into a family restaurant alone and orders a chocolate parfait?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why should I care? And why a chocolate parfait?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:19.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You haven't gone to the restaurant Nagisa works at, yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.23,0:10:22.19,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You don't want to see her in her waitress uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:27.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:33.83,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But if I get caught taking pictures as her father, I'd be a laughingstock of the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:38.08,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So I'm going as your friend #1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll be found out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll only look like a strange rapper to those who don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:46.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,YO! YO! I'm the MC Akio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:49.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm holding the mike and am the invincible baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.05,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're totally giving yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Seriously? You mean that? Crap, Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Whatever. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.11,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bro, wait, Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:22.25,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This place used to be a grove; it was full of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:26.42,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Man, things can really change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:35.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:46.69,Default,Sug,0,0,0,,Welcom- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.57,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.36,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:57.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,An anonymous rapper, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.12,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.91,Default,Sug,0,0,0,,Rie-chan, the manager's looking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:08.84,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,Two customers. This way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:14.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Glad to see this place so lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.60,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I bet this area will change a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.98,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What's with that crappy face of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:23.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:28.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Welcome, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:33.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:38.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well, I got some free time, so I came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:44.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I heard from Nishina-san and Sugisaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:47.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:50.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't recognize him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:54.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, this is my first time meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Here's the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:01.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.27,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,See? She couldn't tell it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like father, like daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.49,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Leave the compliment at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you ready to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll have a hot coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:20.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He'll have a parfait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The biggest one you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:28.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,One order of hot coffee and one chocolate and strawberry mix parfait diamond special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:30.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll be back with them shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:32.63,Default,Waiter,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:37.59,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why do I have to eat something as fancy as this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to have a parfait?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:43.26,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Did I ever utter a single word of wanting to eat one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You said out loud that you wanted one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:48.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:56.99,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san is very popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.99,0:14:00.91,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,There seem to be customers who come here wanting to see her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.91,0:14:03.45,Default,Sug,0,0,0,,Rie-chan, she's no longer Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.04,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,Oh right. She's Okazaki Nagisa-san now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'd call it uniform magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.88,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She does look extra cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.34,Default,Sug,0,0,0,,Rie-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:22.51,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey, what time do you get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:26.14,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to dinner, so let's go eat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:29.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll have to go straight home after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:34.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I need to get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.78,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:37.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:38.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.03,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,"Go"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:40.86,Default,Sug,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.87,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We won't start any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:45.58,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Come on. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:47.16,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:51.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's been years; I never expected to see you in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:55.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You're disturbing the other customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:58.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Step outside, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:02.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'm never coming back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:03.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.43,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Damn, they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The manager wants to see you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:13.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:18.11,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll leave the problems to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:20.11,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bye bye boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:26.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, I was happy that you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:35.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But when I think about you getting yelled at by the manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:41.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't tell him that you're my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:43.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, I don't want you to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:52.64,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Your wife is a very hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:53.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He knows already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:57.52,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Nishina-kun and Sugisaka-kun told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:01.36,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I wanted to greet you since it was a good opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:04.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:08.58,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Oh no. After all, your precious wife was being accosted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:11.29,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I can imagine what you must have felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.67,Default,Man,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, something similar happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:20.76,Default,Man,0,0,0,,That time, she handled the situation well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:23.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Handled the situation? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:30.31,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Apparently she's physically weak and has no work experience, but she's smart and has a strong mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:34.52,Default,Man,0,0,0,,People like her are crucial to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:40.40,Default,Man,0,0,0,,But she is too serious; she is easily depressed when she makes a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:43.65,Default,Man,0,0,0,,so at times like that, please take care of her at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:48.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you for all your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:54.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please keep watching over Nagi- I mean, my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:16:58.54,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Likewise. It's a pleasure to have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:02.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like you found yourself a new place, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:07.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. It reminds me of the days I was working hard with the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:10.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You looked good in the uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:13.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My friend #1 said you looked cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.77,0:17:19.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I-I'm not cute. Nishina-san and Sugisaka-san are much cuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:24.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I just remembered something Nishina-san told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:29.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Apparently a new building's going to be built at the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:32.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They're going to tear down the old building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:39.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,New students two years from now will get to study in brand new classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's not good at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It didn't sound like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:21.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to apologize if I said something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What made you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:31.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:34.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It just made me upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:36.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:39.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That old building has the Theater Club's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:42.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's the place where we worked hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:45.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:49.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll miss that building when it goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:51.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:56.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, I think I'm being touchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:03.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, it was thoughtless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:09.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was really out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:25.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so uneasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The city's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:36.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Both Nagisa and I... and everything around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And, when everything completely changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:47.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even so, can you keep on loving this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:59.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Look, they're finally printed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:02.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When did you take all of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:07.82,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I went back many times after that and took these!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I put much work into these.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.28,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,At times, I'd be belly down on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:17.58,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,On other times, I'd be hidden in the kitchen and aim for an acrobatic angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:19.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they didn't kick you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:22.46,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What are the girls up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:25.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I want to show off my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:29.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know. But Nagisa said she wanted to ask Sanae-san something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey wait, you're going to show them the pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:36.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nagisa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:39.97,Default,San,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I just felt sick for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:47.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What? Are you pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:49.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Have some tact!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:55.53,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Actually, if you were a man, she should be by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:58.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,Looks like she is pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:20:59.08,Default,2,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.45,Default,San,0,0,0,,A baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:03.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Whose? Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:06.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's Nagisa and Tomoya-san's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:12.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute, Sanae! A baby, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:14.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Did a bird drop one off for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:17.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Or did she pick one up in a cabbage patch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:22.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,N-No, Dad. Tomoya-kun and I are married, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:25.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait, she isn't going to say it, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:31.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...we are doing dirty things!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:37.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To say this so frankly to her parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:41.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She must be a rare animal on this Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:44.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:48.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She hasn't had her period, so I'm pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:54.92,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.05,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:03.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.06,0:22:09.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:43.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:42.28,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is Yagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:46.37,Default,San,0,0,0,,She is my friend and works as a midwife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.66,0:23:48.95,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,I'm Yagi. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.95,0:23:50.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm Okazaki Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.91,0:23:52.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:54.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm her husband, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:55.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You will have the baby, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:02.09,Default,San,0,0,0,,When I had Nagisa in my stomach, you said that you'd protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:09.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 15
